1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,275
W: I overheard you mentioning to the sales manager that you and your wife are into watching movies.

2
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:08,395
Will you be seeing one this weekend by any chance?

3
00:00:08,835 --> 00:00:13,455
M: Yes, I was thinking of checking out the Sunday matinée at the Imperial Six Cinema.

4
00:00:14,205 --> 00:00:16,415
They are playing Mary Poppins there this weekend.

5
00:00:17,255 --> 00:00:20,495
You see, I am a real big fan of classical flicks.

6
00:00:20,775 --> 00:00:22,035
W: Oh, that's perfect.

7
00:00:22,215 --> 00:00:25,955
I got these two complimentary tickets that you can use at that theater.

8
00:00:26,675 --> 00:00:31,555
My brother works there, and he gave them to me, but I have to go out of town this weekend.

9
00:00:31,895 --> 00:00:33,295
Why don't you put them to good use?

10
00:00:33,815 --> 00:00:34,195
M: Really?

11
00:00:34,735 --> 00:00:35,835
That's very nice of you.

12
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,395
I really appreciate it.
